    "https://hr.umn.edu/jobs/Why-UMN/Benefits-UMN": {
      "title": "Breadcrumb",
      "description": "Benefits at UMN | University of Minnesota Office of Human Resources Skip to main content Go to the University of Minnesota Twin Cities home page One Stop MyU : For Students, Faculty, and Staff Search Office of Human Resources Jobs Why the UMN Benefits at UMN Relocation Assistance Find a Job Search UMN Jobs UMN Student Jobs Featured Positions U Services Positions Veterinary Technician Positions Executive Searches Associate Chancellor - Crookston Executive Director of Admissions – UMN Duluth Executive Medical Director - Boynton Health Vice Chancellor for Enrollment Management - UMN Morris Applicant Support Using the Job Application System Application and Interview Guidance UMN Graduate Assistant Job Guidance UMN Undergraduate Student Job Guidance Veteran Employment Guidance Contact Breadcrumb Home Why the UMN Benefits at UMN Benefits at UMN At the University of Minnesota, you'll discover meaningful work, a welcoming community, and endless opportunities for growth. And when you join the University of Minnesota and work where your work matters, we’ll keep you covered with benefits for you and your family that are truly in a class of their own. A Job You Can Be Proud of 85% of staff are proud to work at the University of Minnesota. A Supportive Institution 91% of faculty say their job provides them with the opportunity to do challenging and interesting work. On this page Affordable Health Plans | Retirement and Financial Benefits | Benefits Beyond Compare | Tuition, Professional Development, and Work-life Balance | Join a Thriving Community Affordable Health Plans That Care for You When You Need It Most Medical Plans The University offers five comprehensive medical benefit plan options. While plan copayments, deductibles, rates, and provider networks vary, the University works hard to keep plans affordable for all employees. Pharmacy Benefits: You are automatically enrolled in prescription drug coverage with your medical plan selection. Dental Plans The University offers two dental plans that provide in-network preventive care at 100% coverage, plus comprehensive coverage for most dental conditions, including orthodontic treatment for children. Award-Winning Wellbeing Program UMN employees can save hundreds of dollars off health premiums by participating in fun and engaging opportunities through the Wellbeing Program . Retirement and Financial Benefits to Secure Your Future Retirement Benefits Benefits-eligible employees are automatically enrolled in the Minnesota State Retirement System pension plan or the Faculty Retirement Plan, so that you can rest easy knowing your future is secure. Plans include up to a 10% employer contribution towards your retirement savings Financial Counseling Opportunities The University offers a variety of financial counseling services to support employees, spouses, and dependents, including free financial webinars. Explore our financial counseling resources “ I came to the University for the benefits, and I'm staying at the University for the benefits. Dwayne H. Delivery Service Driver Read Dwayne's story Benefits Beyond Compare The University of Minnesota is proud to provide an extensive range of benefits built to support you and your family so you can focus on being your best. Additional Benefits Include Life Insurance coverage Disability Insurance HSA and FSA options Employee Assistance Program Learn more by exploring all of our benefits “ I like that I work at an organization with a mission that I support that also offers excellent family benefits. The University has a huge pool of job opportunities, so there's something here for everyone. Bryn R. Read Bryn's Story Tuition, Professional Development, and Work-life Balance At the University of Minnesota, your opportunities for growth are limitless. Whether it’s tuition benefits where you can tap our world-class faculty in your pursuit of a degree, or professional development opportunities so you can learn and grow in your career, there’s no stopping you here. Tuition Benefits Our tuition benefit program provides eligible employees with free or reduced tuition for classes. Tuition benefits can be used for undergraduate classes, graduate school, or professional course credits. Learn about the Regents Tuition Benefit Program Professional Development Opportunities We offer a variety of opportunities for professional development, including flexible programs designed exclusively for faculty and staff to help you grow and thrive. Work-life Balance and Flexibility The University of Minnesota offers a flexible work culture to support a workforce where people are connected, engaged, thriving, and achieving. Learn more about our flexible work options . A Better You Awaits Take classes to learn and grow . Take classes to improve your job skills . Take classes for fun . Take classes for free . “ The University offers great benefits, especially the Regents [Tuition Benefit Program]. I'm hoping to take advantage of reduced-price classes to continue learning about ecology and the history of this area. That way, I'll be able to better use the land's history to inform its future. Alex W. Natural Areas Gardner Read Alex's story Join a Thriving Community When you work at the University of Minnesota, you will find a welcoming community of people with a variety of perspectives and experiences who are dedicated to improving society and enriching the lives of rising generations. Learn more about working at UMN Talent Acquisition | UMN Office of Human Resources Contact Email: [email protected] Student Employment Email: [email protected] Quick Links Find a Job Comprehensive Benefits Using the Application System This unit has systemwide responsibilities. Learn more about the University of Minnesota System . For Students, Faculty, and Staff One Stop MyU : For Students, Faculty, and Staff © 2026 Regents of the University of Minnesota . All rights reserved. The University of Minnesota is an equal opportunity educator a