      "title": "Breadcrumb",
      "description": "Applicant Support | University of Minnesota Office of Human Resources Skip to main content Go to the University of Minnesota Twin Cities home page One Stop MyU : For Students, Faculty, and Staff Search Office of Human Resources Jobs Why the UMN Benefits at UMN Relocation Assistance Find a Job Search UMN Jobs UMN Student Jobs Featured Positions U Services Positions Veterinary Technician Positions Executive Searches Associate Chancellor - Crookston Executive Director of Admissions – UMN Duluth Executive Medical Director - Boynton Health Vice Chancellor for Enrollment Management - UMN Morris Applicant Support Using the Job Application System Application and Interview Guidance UMN Graduate Assistant Job Guidance UMN Undergraduate Student Job Guidance Veteran Employment Guidance Contact Breadcrumb Home Applicant Support Applicant Support Using the Job Application System Review helpful tips and guidance to navigate the University of Minnesota's job application system. Application and Interview Guidance Review the application and interview guidance for the University of Minnesota. UMN Graduate Student Job Guidance Review guidance for University of Minnesota graduate student job applicants. UMN Undergraduate Student Job Guidance Review guidance for University of Minnesota undergraduate student job applicants. Veteran Employment Guidance Learn how military veterans and service members can build meaningful careers at the University of Minnesota. Explore job opportunities, translate military skills, and access veteran support resources. Talent Acquisition | UMN Office of Human Resources Contact Email: [email protected] Student Employment Email: [email protected] Quick Links Find a Job Comprehensive Benefits Using the Application System This unit has systemwide responsibilities. Learn more about the University of Minnesota System . For Students, Faculty, and Staff One Stop MyU : For Students, Faculty, and Staff © 2026 Regents of the University of Minnesota